  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Grate carrot.<br>• Using paper towel, pat tofu dry and cut into 1cm chunks.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine tofu, the plain flour, sweet soy seasoning and a pinch of salt and pepper.<br>• In a small bowl, combine hoisin sauce, the soy sauce, brown sugar, vinegar <br>and water. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/691aa0341d103273ffd52d77/step-80f2d500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• When the oil is hot, shake excess flour off the tofu and cook, turning occasionally, until golden, 4-6 mins.<br>• Reduce heat to medium and add in sauce mixture, gently tossing to coat, <br>30 seconds.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/691aa0341d103273ffd52d77/step-888fb910.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine shredded cabbage mix, carrot and a drizzle of the vinegar and olive oil. Season.<br>• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/691aa0341d103273ffd52d77/step-013a7120.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide tortillas between plates. <br>• Spread with the mayonnaise, then top with Asian slaw and hoisin tofu to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/691aa0341d103273ffd52d77/step-5fdfac30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
